  "details": "I kinda ran into a semi-glitch, where I wouldn't become the blue loading avatar whilst switching avatars.\n\nthis idea may sound strange, but maybe this could be somewhat beneficial?\n\ncurrently, when switching avatars of different heights, you'll switch from your previous avatar into the blue guy, then into the avatar you wanted to switch into.\n\nwhat if, instead, our current avatar gains a loading bar above it, and then when loading is finished, you instantly swap to the avatar you've chosen, skipping the blue avatar phase completely.\n\nthe only time you'll see or be the blue guy is if someone, or yourself are loading into the world and you don't have their or your avatars loaded for the first time.\n\nthis \n  1: would reduce vertigo\n  2: would make these transitions look and feel a lot smoother",
